! Step 13 hand-back

Head `746f36483e50f6f069d33c843800ded2c6980e93`; worktree clean; no live seats; no push. Relay requests 021–022 received receipts; next request 023. The commit carries the supplied attribution trailers. The state counter remains 13.

* Cleared one blind-read P3 test residue: `face-grant-record.test.ts` now checks an epoch-free grant with a changed outer grant signature and, independently, a changed epoch-free founder edge signature under a freshly re-signed outer grant. The intact epoch-free record remains the control. Replaced the obsolete proposed-shape comment. Relay 021: 24 pass, 0 fail. This adds a test, not a production behavior change; no artificial red was claimed.
* Traced the live wake: `operator-daemon-behavior.ts` subscribes the seat to `ctx.composite` daemon-bag changes, while browser standing comes from its own repo board (`readDyadFromBoard`). Node standing travels over `vesselDyadAsker` / `dyad:ask` to `open-node-vessel.ts`'s `dyadDoor`, which reads `shadowRing.deviceStanding`; `edge-shadow-ring.ts` watches the vessel's board and refolds on changes. No board-to-seat wake has been verified or wired on either shore. A daemon-island board listener alone does not prove the node path, whose authoritative fold lives on the vessel. Next step should produce caller-level reds with unchanged-aside controls and wire wake after the relevant fold completes, accounting for lifecycle and asynchronous ordering.
* Founder lineage freshness, non-memoized fork changes, tri-state ring, remaining epoch-free consumer/type and test hygiene, daemon join wiring/TOCTOU, complete-view census, and the three remaining readers all remain owed. The census must use independently supported completeness: `kapae.mem` #/four-edges explicitly says the edge board holds no roster and cannot claim a whole set. The roll guard and epoch fields remain intact.

Whole non-daemon suites remain due before ready; daemon packages run named single files through the broker; e2e stays in CI. Blind Opus custody read precedes land; no push without controller go.

